{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "eafa2b31-f73e-8f96-8deb-cf2238503466",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T12:13:10-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Josephine Cardillo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:11:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:11:47-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. There's a catch basin at the corner by 434 Dixon Street, North End. It's clogged with leaves. Been like that since before the holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:11:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is it backing up into the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:11:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not backing up. It's dry out. But the puddle never drains. Sits there all the time. Now it's a sheet of ice in the mornings."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ugh, yeah, that'll do it. Which corner, do you know? Dixon and what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The corner right by my building. The one in front of the house on the left, as you come down. You'll see the leaves piled on the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll put in a request for a crew to clear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. My neighbor's older. She can't get out when it's icy like that. She won't walk past it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful, I'll note it on the ticket so they know it's a safety thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do the crews work weekends? If it's Saturday I'd like to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sometimes, but I'd plan on a weekday visit. Could be in the next few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Sorry, I'm rushing. Just got back from a driving lesson with my son. He's learning. I'm still shaking a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:12:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I remember those. Do you want a call back when it's done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:13:03-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No need. Just get it cleared."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:13:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks for calling, Josephine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T12:13:09-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
